jet new — Create a Jet project or backend source scaffold

  jet new <name> [--template cli|ui|web|overrides] | new service|route|job|migration <name> [--path <path>] [--route <path>] [--model <name>] [--up|--sql <SQL>] [--down <SQL>] [--risk <note>] [--lock <shared|exclusive>] [--version <n>] [--preview|--apply|--remove]
  --json                       Emit machine-readable facts or diagnostics
  --quiet                      Suppress non-error status output
  --color                      Color: auto | always | never
  --version                    Set bundle or migration version; global flag prints compiler version
  --apply                      Apply the verified artifact or planned source writes
  --preview                    Preview deterministic backend source writes without applying them
  --remove                     Remove only unchanged outputs recorded by the scaffold receipt
  --path                       Route or output path, defaulting to `/<name>`
  --route                      Alias for `--path`
  --model                      Model name recorded beside the route source
  --lock                       Lock dependency fetching or choose a migration/scaffold lock policy
  --annotated                  Include commented example deps
  --template                   Start from a named template: cli, ui, web, or overrides
  --up                         Checked forward SQL
  --sql                        Alias for checked forward SQL
  --down                       Checked inverse SQL for rollback
  --risk                       Data-risk note shown before writes
